WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.520
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I'm going to&nbsp;
explain an American science fiction thriller&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.320
film called “The Thinning New World Order.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.320
It is 2039 and the Earth has become overpopulated,&nbsp;
and all nations must annually cut their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:24.240
populations by 5%. The United States implements&nbsp;
the rule called "Thinning." In the thinning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.840
the students must attend a standardized test every&nbsp;
year. In the test, whoever fails is executed. 
&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.680
However, the thinning scoring system was rigged.&nbsp;
The Officials manipulated the results to pass&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.880
whoever they want, usually the children of rich&nbsp;
parents. In the end, the foul play of the scoring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:46.560
system was exposed by a student named Laina.
Blake Redding, the son of Texas Governor, Dean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.200
Redding, failed the ‘thinning test’. He and the&nbsp;
others who failed the test were to be executed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.880
However, unknown to the public, they were instead&nbsp;
sent to an underground slave labor facility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:01.920
to manufacture goods like phones and electronics&nbsp;
for a company called Assuru Global. This way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:06.720
the company profits off cheap labor. 
It is now the following day of the thinning.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.080
Blake and the other students who had failed&nbsp;
are brought to the underground facility.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
There, they watch a video of a lady explaining&nbsp;
that they are the chosen ones, who get a second&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:20.480
chance at life. The place is called an incubator&nbsp;
and is designed by Assuru. They have been brought&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.520
here to work for the company. Lastly, she reveals&nbsp;
that the most productive member of the incubator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.080
program gets reintroduced to society. The&nbsp;
people happily celebrate being alive. 
&nbsp;

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.520
The system then tells them to go to their&nbsp;
respective assignment room. A teaching device has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.480
been inserted in all of their necks. An automated&nbsp;
voice explains to them their tasks and routines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:45.280
They will have to work for fourteen hours a day&nbsp;
before they get one hour of dining and personal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:50.800
time. They will also get curfews, in which they&nbsp;
have to go to their assigned beds and rest. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:56.160
watching the videos, Blake notices his long-lost&nbsp;
girlfriend, Ellie, in a clip. Blake goes looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:01.280
for her and the two finally meet. Blake cannot&nbsp;
believe that she is alive. Ellie tells him to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:06.480
her in an hour when they have a curfew. The two&nbsp;
meet at the living unit, and have sex. Later that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.440
night, Blake is talking to his friend, Heather,&nbsp;
when a siren starts ringing in the facility.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.000
One of the workers is trying to commit suicide&nbsp;
because he doesn’t want to work anymore. A group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.920
of boys from below encourage the boy to jump. Cage&nbsp;
is the leader of a group. The boy eventually jumps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:27.280
,but the guards lay the nets right before and save&nbsp;
him. It turns out that anyone who refuses to work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:31.360
is sent to an infirmary where they are injected&nbsp;
with some kind of drug to docile them. 
&nbsp;

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:36.240
Cage then comes to meet Blake at his living unit.&nbsp;
He tells him that Ellie is his girlfriend now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:40.800
and he should stay away from her. The following&nbsp;
day at the cafeteria, Ellie sits alone at a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:46.000
table when Cage approaches and kisses her. Ellie&nbsp;
seems uncomfortable the whole time. Heather and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.800
Blake watch the event unfold from their table,&nbsp;
but cannot do anything. Cage and his team are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:55.120
called ‘the worthy’. They are hand-selected&nbsp;
by the incubator to supervise other workers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:00.160
After the group leaves the table, Blake&nbsp;
approaches Ellie. Frightened for his safety,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:05.600
she asks him to go away. Just then, Cage’s men&nbsp;
approach Blake and tell him to leave Ellie alone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.520
Blake fights the men, but soon, Cage&nbsp;
intervenes and overpowers Blake.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.880
Ellie and Blake manage to run away from the&nbsp;
cafeteria, but they are then caught by Mason King,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.800
the ex-supervisor of the thinning exam who&nbsp;
has been relocated to the incubator after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:23.280
the thinning scandal. After catching him,&nbsp;
Mason twists Blake’s leg and breaks it. 
&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.920
Back in the town of Texas, everyone is at Blake’s&nbsp;
memorial service, as Blake is presumed dead by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:36.880
public after he failed the test, Many reporters&nbsp;
try to interview his father, Governor Dean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:42.160
as he exits the premises. Laina has been on the&nbsp;
press’s radar after she successfully exposed the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:45.680
foul play of the thinning's scoring system.&nbsp;
The reporters try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:50.000
to interview her, but she dismisses them.&nbsp;
The thinning fraud incident has caused a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.280
huge dent in Dean’s reputation. He managed to&nbsp;
blame the foul scoring system on Mason King,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:00.800
the exam supervisor, but the DPC has appointed a&nbsp;
private investigator named Agent Joanne Morris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.880
to investigate the incident. 
Agent Joanne visits Laina at her home the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:10.160
following day. However, Laina doesn’t provide her&nbsp;
with any important information, so Joanne gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:16.400
Laina her card and leaves. Just then, a man knocks&nbsp;
on her door. It is a security guard named Jack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:21.920
who has come to invite Laina to meet Dean. 
Later, we see Laina at Dean’s, he reveals that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.560
he wants her help in his campaign&nbsp;
for the presidential election.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:30.240
She strictly denies the job and leaves.&nbsp;
On her way, she meets Assuru Global’s CEO,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:35.360
Georgina Preston. Assuru Global helps Dean&nbsp;
financially in his election campaigns, hence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:40.400
Dean and Georgina work together closely. Georgina&nbsp;
vaguely tells Laina that she should consider the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:45.440
job for her siblings, Corrine and Joey. She&nbsp;
tries bribing her, saying that her siblings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:49.600
don’t have to appear for the thinning test if&nbsp;
she works for them, but she still refuses. 
&nbsp;

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:54.160
As Jack drives them back, he goes further&nbsp;
than Laina’s home. When she points it out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:58.240
some kind of gas begins to fill the car and&nbsp;
makes Laina and her siblings unconscious.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:03.200
Laina wakes up in a deserted construction site,&nbsp;
with Jack and a few others standing in front of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:08.240
her. Corrine’s elementary school teacher, Miss&nbsp;
Cole, is there too. It turns out that Jack and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.840
Miss Cole work for an organization called&nbsp;
‘the fight’, which is against the thinning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:16.320
system. If Dean is elected as the president, the&nbsp;
thinning will never end so they need Laina’s help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:21.280
to work as their spy. They want her to take&nbsp;
the job Dean just provided. Laina agrees. 
&nbsp;

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:27.200
Meanwhile, Laina’s best friend, Kellan, gets a&nbsp;
job as an intern in the Tv news company with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.000
news reporter named Wendy Banks. That day,&nbsp;
Kellan is doing his research on the after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:37.040
process of thinning. He realizes that no one&nbsp;
handles the dead bodies after execution.
&nbsp;

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:40.720
At night he goes to Laina’s, and&nbsp;
asks her to join him at the cemetery.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.960
The two go there and dig up Blake’s grave ,and&nbsp;
are surprised, to find his coffin empty. 
&nbsp;

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:50.880
Cut to eight months later. It is two weeks until&nbsp;
the election date. Dean has been campaigning for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:55.760
the elections and Laina continues working in his&nbsp;
support. She has also been constantly providing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.760 --> 00:06:00.240
Miss Cole with all the information she could&nbsp;
gather. That day, they meet at a construction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:05.920
site again. Laina is furious at being made to&nbsp;
support Dean Redding’s ideas. She accuses them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:10.880
of doing nothing they promised to. Miss Cole calms&nbsp;
her down, and tells her that they now know that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:15.600
all the necessary information is in Georgina’s&nbsp;
computer. They provide her with a device to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:20.640
access her computer. Laina has to now figure out a&nbsp;
way to get to Georgina’s computer undetected. 
&nbsp;

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:25.440
Meanwhile, Blake and the others have been working&nbsp;
in the incubator for the past eight months too.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:31.120
Blake’s leg has still not healed. He limps when&nbsp;
he walks. He has not been able to communicate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:36.880
with Ellie either. That night, Cage and his group&nbsp;
come into Blake’s living area while he is asleep.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:41.520
They gag him and hit his leg repeatedly&nbsp;
as he whimpers in pain. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:46.160
he goes to Dr. Langley’s clinic and tells her&nbsp;
that he fell in the shower. When he comes back,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:49.680
he tells Heather to inform Ellie to be&nbsp;
at Cage’s boxing match the next day. 
&nbsp;

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:55.360
Meanwhile, Kellan manages to crack the secret of&nbsp;
the labour camps, saying Assuru Global doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.840
have a manufacturing area on their campus and&nbsp;
they have been insourcing military rations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.320
from a company called TXPak, being able to&nbsp;
serve food to 100,000 people per year.
&nbsp;

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:10.240
However, his boss Wendy dismisses him, saying&nbsp;
that without a photo or video evidence, they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:15.600
cannot publish the story. When he gets in his car&nbsp;
that day, a masked man from the back seat tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:21.280
suffocate him. He somehow manages to free himself&nbsp;
and flees to Laina’s house. He knows that someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:26.160
from Assuru is always listening, so he informs&nbsp;
Laina of his revelations by writing in a notebook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.920
It is now the day of the election. Laina drops&nbsp;
her siblings off at Miss Cole’s and leaves for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:36.160
Assuru’s building, where Dean and his supporters&nbsp;
patiently wait for the election results. 
&nbsp;

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.920
Laina kisses Jack in the elevator, and the&nbsp;
two wish each other luck. Sometime later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:41.120
Laina goes to the restroom, where&nbsp;
a security guard escorts her. 
&nbsp;

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.000
Meanwhile, at the incubator, Blake is at one of&nbsp;
Cage’s matches when he presents himself to fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:51.120
Cage. The whole crowd watching the match goes&nbsp;
silent. Blake wants to be the leader of the group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:56.720
if he wins. Cage agrees to the challenge. They&nbsp;
then fight. Even though Blake’s leg is injured, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:02.240
overpowers Cage. The crowd starts chanting Blake’s&nbsp;
name. After an intense fight, Blake wins. 
&nbsp;

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:08.000
Meanwhile, Ellie is in her bed and isn’t moving.&nbsp;
When the guards come near her, she attacks them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.320
determined to get out of the facility. 
The guards eventually restrain her and take her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:17.120
to the infirmary for her punishment. After his&nbsp;
win, Blake gathers Cage’s group and tells them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:21.840
that none of the students from the thinning are&nbsp;
killed. They are brought down for cheap labor. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:25.840
also reveals that the reintroduction to society&nbsp;
is a lie and they will be stuck there forever.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:31.360
After a lot of convincing, the group finally&nbsp;
agrees to work together to fight the system.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.880
Blake and one of the guys go to get Ellie,&nbsp;
while others go to the cafeteria.
&nbsp;

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:39.440
Laina on the other hand jumps out of the&nbsp;
bathroom’s window and somehow manages to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:44.640
reach Georgina’s office. There, she uses the hard&nbsp;
drive that Miss Cole gave her to gain access to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:49.760
the computer. She finds out all the camera footage&nbsp;
from the incubator, and is beyond surprised and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:54.720
delighted to see that Blake is alive. She quickly&nbsp;
transfers all the information to the hard drive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.280 --> 00:09:00.160
However, while she is in the office, Georgina&nbsp;
is about to come in. Jack stalls her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.800
saying that Dean wants to meet her urgently. Till&nbsp;
then, Laina takes the hard drive and gets back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:10.880
to the restroom. However, after being caught in a&nbsp;
lie, Jack is restrained by the guards. Laina then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.040
quickly calls agent Joanne Morris, who had been&nbsp;
appointed to investigate the thinning’s case.
&nbsp;

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:20.160
At the incubator, Blake deliberately hurts&nbsp;
himself to be taken to the clinic where Ellie is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:25.920
There, he and a friend get rid of a guard, and&nbsp;
stop the doctors from injecting Ellie with a drug.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:31.280
The two then take out the tracking device in their&nbsp;
necks and flee. In the cafeteria, Cage and a guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:36.560
start a fight, as their plan to stall the guards.&nbsp;
Soon, all the other workers join creating chaos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:40.800
Mason gets to know this and goes&nbsp;
to the cafeteria with other guards.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.160
He is furious and checks Blake’s tracking&nbsp;
device to see he is in the clinic. 
&nbsp;

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:49.760
Meanwhile, Laina and Joanne meet at a terrace.&nbsp;
Laina gives her the hard drive and tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.080
everything she knows about Assuru. Joanne&nbsp;
gets all the information she needs. But it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:57.840
turns out that Joanne too is corrupt, and works&nbsp;
for Assuru. She then holds Laina at gunpoint.
&nbsp;

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:01.200
Laina somehow defends herself and&nbsp;
manages to run away with the hard drive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:06.560
She goes to Kellan, who makes a copy of the&nbsp;
file to take it to Wendy to broadcast it. Laina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:12.240
stays at his house for her safety. However, as&nbsp;
Kellan starts his car, it explodes, killing him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:21.760
Joanne and some men come looking for Laina. She&nbsp;
sets up a trap and runs out through the back door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:27.360
The guards fall into the trap, creating an&nbsp;
explosion. However, Joanne comes out unharmed. 
&nbsp;

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:31.840
She attacks Laina again; but this time, Laina&nbsp;
pushes her off the stairs, killing her. 
&nbsp;

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:37.440
Meanwhile, Jake and Ellie dress up as the nurses&nbsp;
and run through the basement of the incubator.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:42.400
Mason follows them behind. The two find a ladder&nbsp;
reaching the top of the tunnel and climb up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.880
eventually getting out of it. They celebrate&nbsp;
happily, and are about to run when Mason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:50.960
reaches there and attacks them. 
Elsewhere, at the Assuru building,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:56.000
the election results come out in the favor&nbsp;
of Dean. Everyone celebrates happily. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:00.960
now the new president of the United States. 
Meanwhile, Laina finally reaches the BNC News&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:05.680
centre, and shows Wendy Banks the proof. They&nbsp;
quickly rush to the opening of the incubator&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:10.960
in a chopper. They broadcast Mason fighting&nbsp;
Blake. Dean sees the broadcast and is beyond&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:17.040
surprised to see his son still alive. Still, he&nbsp;
gives his first presidential speech. Dean’s PA&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:23.040
tells Georgina that there is no way around this&nbsp;
scandal now. However, Georgina has a plan. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:28.240
arrests everyone who ever talked against Redding,&nbsp;
and plans to end democracy once and for all. 
&nbsp;

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:33.040
Blake and Laina finally reunite and kiss.&nbsp;
They stop when Laina sees Ellie behind Blake.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:36.960
Just then, they too are arrested for&nbsp;
speaking against the thinning test.
&nbsp;

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:42.720
As the police drive them, they get into an&nbsp;
accident but thankfully are not injured. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:47.360
Jake comes to them and frees them. Jack tells&nbsp;
them that they will defeat Redding and Georgina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:51.600
and take things back to normal. The movie&nbsp;
ends abruptly hinting at the third sequel. 
&nbsp;

